WEBVTT

02:34.730 --> 02:39.570
<i>Episode 12 Dynasty Restoration.</i>

02:41.990 --> 02:43.300
Who are you?

02:43.330 --> 02:46.330
Have you come knowingly to commit a
serious of fence against Lord Yamikubo?!

02:47.620 --> 02:49.550
Prepare to meet your death.

02:49.580 --> 02:51.290
Yagyus.

02:51.830 --> 02:53.420
Pawns of the Tokugawas!

03:36.960 --> 03:39.920
Whoa... How was it?!

04:00.860 --> 04:04.170
Hey, you sure this
is the right way?

04:04.200 --> 04:11.050
Not sure, but the lost kingdom is supposed
to be in a mountain somewhere around here.

04:11.080 --> 04:13.210
I-If that's all we know,
we'll be walking endlessly.

04:28.050 --> 04:30.060
The work of the
Kimon Clan, perhaps.

04:36.310 --> 04:37.520
Let's go.

04:40.900 --> 04:42.900
Wait up!

05:29.950 --> 05:31.330
What are you going to do?

05:46.340 --> 05:48.890
You must be very tired.

05:50.890 --> 05:52.140
Here.

06:12.120 --> 06:13.450
Go.

06:19.670 --> 06:23.180
I am sure Jubei Kibagami,

06:23.210 --> 06:28.650
who holds half of the Dragon Stone,
will come searching for the Light Maiden.

06:28.680 --> 06:30.060
Hmm.

06:30.090 --> 06:36.060
Then I can finally take
possession of the lost treasures.

07:30.780 --> 07:32.660
You'll be the lookout here!

07:53.260 --> 07:54.390
Shh.

08:41.640 --> 08:45.020
Jubei Kibagami, you
will not escape us.

08:45.400 --> 08:47.410
Old fart, take care of Shigure!

08:47.440 --> 08:48.440
You betcha.

09:51.590 --> 09:53.250
Bastard!

10:36.630 --> 10:39.180
Wait, we're not here to fight.

10:44.140 --> 10:48.940
Oh, there you are. We've
been looking for you.

10:49.640 --> 10:50.730
. Hmm? Huh?

10:58.240 --> 11:00.710
Hey, what's with them?

11:00.740 --> 11:02.740
Must be the Hiruko Clan.

11:03.280 --> 11:07.010
We appreciate you for
saving our Light Maiden.

11:07.040 --> 11:08.750
From here on,
we will protect her.

11:09.460 --> 11:11.090
What's with you guys?

11:11.120 --> 11:13.750
Come out of nowhere and
tell us you're in charge?!

11:14.340 --> 11:15.500
Dear Maiden...

11:16.090 --> 11:19.770
We Hiruko, ever
since our kingdom fell,

11:19.800 --> 11:24.180
have been continuously watching
and protecting you from our shadowland.

11:25.140 --> 11:27.720
All this time... me...

11:28.520 --> 11:31.160
Until the time was ripe
for reviving the kingdom,

11:31.190 --> 11:33.770
our law dictated that we
would not go out in the open,

11:34.440 --> 11:38.530
but now, the time has come so we
would once again be bathed in light.

11:39.400 --> 11:46.780
Dear Maiden, please join us at the
royal tomb and revive the ancient kingdom.

11:49.500 --> 11:52.750
Dear Maiden, please,
provide us with the Light!

11:53.830 --> 11:56.720
What do you want me to do?

11:56.750 --> 12:00.390
Hey, you don't need
to trust these guys!

12:00.420 --> 12:01.770
Right, Jubei?

12:01.800 --> 12:02.930
I don't know.

12:03.680 --> 12:08.310
I'm only protecting this until you've
accepted that you are the Light Maiden.

12:10.770 --> 12:12.810
I got the stolen half back.

12:13.520 --> 12:17.320
If you trust these guys and want
to act as the Maiden, then it's yours.

12:26.870 --> 12:28.280
Hail to the Maiden!

12:39.130 --> 12:41.680
Great, this is
great. So wonderful.

12:41.710 --> 12:44.310
What's with you, old
fart? You're weirdin' out.

12:44.340 --> 12:47.070
How splendid! Never
thought I'd live to see it!

12:47.100 --> 12:49.180
What a wonderful, wonderful day!

13:14.960 --> 13:16.670
Thanks.

13:22.880 --> 13:25.590
Stay like this, a little longer.

13:31.260 --> 13:33.140
Wait, don't move.

13:44.150 --> 13:45.360
Don't let your guard down.

13:54.580 --> 13:56.510
Are we going to the top of that?

13:56.540 --> 13:58.430
Where is the Maiden?

13:58.460 --> 14:00.460
She is being watched
by your female ninjas.

14:01.630 --> 14:07.650
I have been told that before
this mountain of fire was created,

14:07.680 --> 14:12.100
ours was a kingdom of magnificent splendor,
the envy of all the nations nearby.

14:25.320 --> 14:26.610
There's no need to be concerned.

14:52.680 --> 14:54.810
W-What is going on?!

14:57.520 --> 15:01.280
Our Maiden using
such a strange spell...

15:01.310 --> 15:03.360
What is happening here?

15:10.740 --> 15:11.820
Ashizo! Run!

15:16.490 --> 15:19.160
Hurry, Ashizo! To Mufu!

15:23.040 --> 15:24.040
Watch out!

15:43.190 --> 15:44.480
Guys?

15:59.450 --> 16:01.710
Milady? Light Maiden?

16:15.550 --> 16:17.690
Shigure, are you all right?

16:17.720 --> 16:20.900
Yes... but who would
do such a thing?

16:20.930 --> 16:23.740
Perhaps the remainder
of the Kimon Clan.

16:23.770 --> 16:25.940
We must leave here immediately.

16:43.660 --> 16:45.330
We're almost there.

16:54.260 --> 16:55.430
Hey, guys!

16:55.890 --> 16:56.900
What?!

16:56.930 --> 17:00.060
Huh? Oh, nothing.

17:00.470 --> 17:01.600
Let's hurry.

17:13.990 --> 17:19.410
This is the Ancestral Dragon Stone
that marks the way to the royal tomb.

17:21.370 --> 17:22.370
It looks like...

17:25.920 --> 17:27.960
Yes, they look alike.

17:28.330 --> 17:29.330
Exactly.

17:29.880 --> 17:34.010
The Ancestral Stone used to
look just like the Dragon Stone.

17:34.550 --> 17:37.430
But the eruption deformed it.

17:37.970 --> 17:39.570
What are we to do here?

17:39.600 --> 17:43.030
It is said that by placing the Dragon Stone
in the Dragon Eye of the Ancestral Stone,

17:43.060 --> 17:47.410
and the Maiden playing the song handed down
to her over the generations on her flute,

17:47.440 --> 17:49.060
we can reach the
tomb of the king.

17:50.770 --> 17:53.480
Is that all? Playing the flute?

17:53.820 --> 17:55.900
No, you need this for the flute.

18:09.290 --> 18:10.380
What?

18:11.460 --> 18:14.460
This is the true form
of the Dragon Flute.

18:17.930 --> 18:20.390
Do we have everything now?

18:20.930 --> 18:21.930
Yes.

18:23.180 --> 18:24.720
I see...

18:26.640 --> 18:28.640
Let's finish the job.

18:36.440 --> 18:37.740
How could you?!

18:38.530 --> 18:39.530
You imposter!

18:41.910 --> 18:46.250
My technique is that
of a reflection on water.

18:46.950 --> 18:49.580
I trapped you now with
my reflection technique.

18:58.630 --> 19:00.970
The Maiden. Where is our Maiden?

19:02.050 --> 19:03.350
Right here!

19:07.520 --> 19:08.930
Your Highness!

19:09.560 --> 19:13.060
Utsushie, we have no
use for them anymore!

19:13.610 --> 19:18.570
You guys take those
two and jump into the fire.

19:19.700 --> 19:22.070
Hey, let 90! Quit it!

19:33.130 --> 19:34.970
Wait! Stop!

19:35.000 --> 19:37.760
The Hiruko Clan
cannot perish like this!

19:38.550 --> 19:39.550
Stop!

20:01.070 --> 20:02.070
Jubei?!

20:08.450 --> 20:14.330
<i>Even if this body is burned in the fires
of hell, I will return to take vengeance!</i>

20:18.250 --> 20:20.670
Your Highness!

20:26.220 --> 20:28.680
Well, this is it.

20:29.430 --> 20:31.180
Is that so?

20:34.810 --> 20:38.200
It's too bad, we just
got to know each other.

20:38.230 --> 20:40.790
Then why don't you join me?

20:40.820 --> 20:42.830
Are those your last words?

20:42.860 --> 20:44.360
I'll pass on that.

20:48.410 --> 20:50.410
Bye, Jubei.

20:53.000 --> 20:54.010
Too bad!

20:54.040 --> 20:55.960
You'll need to hang out
with me a little longer!

21:19.940 --> 21:22.610
J-Jubei...

21:33.790 --> 21:36.460
So long, Utsushie.

21:38.250 --> 21:39.540
JubeL...

21:49.890 --> 21:51.060
JubeL.

21:54.680 --> 21:56.770
Jubefl.

23:29.610 --> 23:31.570
<i>Next Episode.</i>

23:32.490 --> 23:35.080
Her journey began in
fire, and now it ends.

23:35.370 --> 23:39.500
What fate awaits her as the
Light Maiden? As Shigure?

23:39.750 --> 23:42.300
Within the ruins, as one
fight ends, another begins.

23:42.330 --> 23:45.760
In the end, who will climb the
mount of corpses and claim the prize?

23:45.790 --> 23:47.930
Yamikubo? Or Renya?

23:47.960 --> 23:52.180
Jubei disappeared into the
lava, but does he yet live?

23:52.590 --> 23:56.560
Next time on Ninja
Scroll: Farewell Jubei.

23:56.640 --> 23:57.610
<i>Episode 13 Farewell
Jubei Witness.</i>

23:57.640 --> 24:01.310
<i>Episode 13 Farewell Jubei</i>
